    "updated_at": "2025-03-10T15:41:25Z",
    "body": "To be clear, I think we should not land this before the other two HTML PRs are ready or the Fetch PR is ready to land. I think those together form an incremental step to a better cookie understanding. Landing each in isolation would be wrong.\r\n\r\nPotentially we could combine those three HTML PRs into one. Not sure what @bvandersloot-mozilla thinks about that.",
