    "body": "> What is the status of this PR? There are a few open comment threads and it's not clear if they're resolved yet or not.\r\n\r\nLooks like it inadvertently got ignored after TPAC. I've adopted our changes from those threads and pending the rewording, it should be good. Though we will need tests for storage access API for the scenarios you outlined in the thread where we moved it to the policy container.",
